    "turn_idx": 45,
    "turn_text": "Well, it's really meant to be public private, and that is to provide for promotion of real news, not fake news, and then also to provide for promotion of free speech of democracy with all the different media platforms that we have. And I think in particular another country that comes to mind where it would be incredible because the young people of that country do want changes call iran and it's not closed and it's hard to imagine that iraq being so close that a satellite dish if you had one you executed and then now we have a country really which has Western aspirations in the culture of Persia that's right in to freedom and democracy and so over and over again I think we've got opportunities around the world and by having the U.S. Information Agency reconstituted to provide but not just individually by the government it would be with working together with the private sector.",
