    "turn_text": "Well, I'm grateful that what we're proposing is the toughest sanctions ever. The Trump administration has already put significant sanctions on Russia, particularly due to their aggression in Moldova and Georgia and Ukraine. But we would also go further more sanctions and then also But Russia, sadly, has been financing terrorist organizations, whether it be Hezbollah or whether it be different terrorist organizations across Syria and possibly into Iraq, and then working with countries that also are state sponsors of Iran and Venezuela, bottom line. We would want to name Russia as a state sponsor of terrorism, and this is where I would hope that Democrats, if they're truly concerned about the danger, which is correct, of the threat to freedom and democracy by an authoritarian Putin regime, we could work together.",
